@startuml
title Warmhouse Scenarios API Execution Component Code Diagram

top to bottom direction

!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml
' !include ../common/C4_Component.puml

class ScenarioStage {
  +deviceId int64
  +commandPayload string
  +Execute(ctx Context) : chan struct{}
}

class StageExecutionContext {
  +Ready chan struct{}
  +Stop(ctx Context)
  +Idx int
}

class GraphExecutionContext {
  +stages []ScenarioStage
  +dependencies [][]int
  +enqueuedStages []int
  +activeStages []StageExecutionContext
  +Stop(ctx Context)
  +GetReady() : chan struct{}
}

class ScenarioGraph {
  +stages []ScenarioStage
  +dependencies [][]int
  +Execute(ctx Context) : ExecutionContext
}

class ScenarioDescription {
  +name string
  +graph ScenarioGraph
}

' Relationships
ScenarioDescription "1" *-- "1" ScenarioGraph : contains
ScenarioGraph "1" *-- "0..*" ScenarioStage : consists of
ScenarioGraph "1" --> "1" GraphExecutionContext : creates
GraphExecutionContext "1" o-- "0..*" ScenarioStage : references
GraphExecutionContext "1" *-- "0..*" StageExecutionContext : manages
StageExecutionContext "1" --> "1" ScenarioStage : executes

' Notes
note top of ScenarioStage
  Represents a single stage (action)
  in a scenario graph.
end note

note right of ScenarioGraph
  Directed acyclic graph of stages
  with dependencies.
end note

note left of GraphExecutionContext
  Manages concurrent execution
  of a scenario graph.
end note

@enduml